OL,3,GNEWSAFears grow for famous cat after
OL,4,Asix weeks missing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a cat with thousands of
OL,7,Fglobal followers on social media said
OL,8,Fshe felt "sick with worry" as he had
OL,9,Fnot been seen for six weeks.
OL,11,FMax is well-known for roaming his home
OL,12,Ftown of Brightlingsea, Essex and even
OL,13,Fstarred in his own calendar.
OL,15,FHis owner Georgie Dunt normally tracks
OL,16,Fhim with a digital tag in his collar,
OL,17,Fbut he lost it at one of his regular
OL,18,Fspots in the town.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
