OL,3,GNEWSAFears grow for famous cat after
OL,4,Asix weeks missing
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There was a little joke at first...
OL,7,Fmaybe he knows and he's gone and done a
OL,8,Fdisappearing act, but it's now six
OL,9,Fweeks and we're starting to worry," she
OL,10,Fsaid.
